rain-core: xray/0053-muxcool-diagnostics
Source: ReClash fix on top of xray/0037 (GPL-3.0).

Add a point-in-time diagnostic snapshot with no hot-path logging and no
ReClash dependency: carrier, idle and draining counts; TCP and UDP sessions;
queued items and bytes; dropped datagrams; session overflows; carrier write
timeouts; pending opens; dial failures; and carrier closes by reason. Pool
counters keep a closed session's loss visible after it leaves the registry.
MuxCool.Stats reports the TCP and XUDP pools and whether UDP shares the TCP
pool.

Tests: TestPoolStatsReportsSessionsQueuesAndDrops,
TestPoolStatsCountsDialFailures, TestMuxCoolStatsReportsPools.
